          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("If Asheviere has truly given Elensefar to the orcs like they claim, it can only be because she expects them to ravage it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("She must believe the people will never submit to her rule, and would rather ruin them entirely than risk another revolt. How awful."),
          },
